Z||000000||Kasdan||08-19-2001||04:48 PM||||I was looking to maybe buy or fabricate a Cowl hood for my 86 GT, could someone help me?||||reg||1
Z||000001||rockcrawl||08-19-2001||05:17 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87gt_1.jpg"> <P>'69 Camaro style fiberglass scoop bonded on with SMC adhesive. I think it was from Harwood. The scoop is designed to take advantage of the high pressure at the base of the windshield to draw air in. I did cut an opening above the radiator, but the effect was probably nothing or negative. It's not really a practical scoop for a Fiero, but it does look pretty cool.||||reg||1
