Z||000005||DrDave||08-19-2001||09:09 PM||||How tall (from hood to surface of the scoop) <BR>is your scoop? I've seen them from 3 inches to 5 inches.  Yours appears to be shorter.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cooter||08-19-2001||09:14 PM||||I got the idea from Rockcrawl a while back and he gave some pretty good instructions on the installation. Mine is from JC Whitney, I believe 2.5 inch tall. It was way too long for the hood and had to have about 4 inches cut from the rear of it.<P>Edited for an extra comment:<BR>Trans-Am leather seats are really nice! Installed a freshly cleaned carpet set and the seats today. <p>[This message has been edited by Cooter (edited 08-19-2001).]||||reg||1
